  "description": "The Beargrease C Frameset is a smart starting point for your dream fat-tire bike. Constructed of carbon fiber for maximum pedaling efficiency and minimal weight, this versatile frameset is designed around trail bike geometry for a stable, confident ride feel on soft and steep terrain. Clearance for 27.5 x 4.5\" or 26 x 4.8″ tires means awesome traction and the ability to float over soft surfaces. Rack, Three-Pack, and other cargo and accessory mounts add function to the fun and let you extend your Adventure by Bike — tackle a winter ultra race, go bikepacking, or simply spend a whole day out on remote trails. Add your favorite components to this fat tire bike frame and see how far it can take you.",
